Course: Algorithm Analysis
Algorithm analysis is the process of evaluating an algorithm's efficiency in terms of time and space complexity.
It helps determine how the algorithm performs as the input size grows, typically using Big O notation.
This analysis guides developers in choosing the most optimal solution for a problem.
